flowchart LR
    U[User] --> UI[Streamlit Frontend]
    UI -->|HTTP / JSON| API[FastAPI Backend]
    API --> UP[CSV Upload and Validation]
    UP --> STORE[In-memory Dataset Store]
    API --> PLAN[Constrained Analysis Planner]
    PLAN -->|Optional, 20s timeout| GEM[Google Gemini]
    PLAN -->|Fallback| RULES[Rule-based Planner]
    STORE --> ENGINE[Pandas Analysis Engine]
    GEM --> ENGINE
    RULES --> ENGINE
    ENGINE --> OUT[Answer, Table, Chart, SQL and Pandas Snippets]
    OUT --> UI
